{"id": "EUVD-2026-103738", "enisaUuid": "6aedc059-6928-3abb-bb02-9b3186a30d73", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnet/mlx5: Fix rev_entry reference leak in mlx5_tc_ct_shared_counter_get()\n\nWhen the reverse entry is found but its counter is already being\nreleased, refcount_inc_not_zero() fails and the reference taken by\nmlx5_tc_ct_entry_get() is never dropped before falling through to\ncreate_counter.  Drop it so the reverse entry is not kept alive forever\nby a shared counter lookup that did not use it.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:16:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:20:36", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/598daa5f95883f881a54967da40ce0fdfc1fdaa8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/79a3257280a335bbebbcd10d3895e8468bdcd6ae", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c45c997d0c27359b502587897f775c5a277f0bd4", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/288721013605b4e0304e10f6a087b77f71cfad11", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/60eab87d0a798070bf5a856b1d9e5785ce92da53", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/99d8dc51663747078c031acac32edc6d90c8f1f7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f13989a0704bd98cab09f9bee63e2c8a98ad4dd", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0bf6bb567f0edaa771e7dd208ef98da50e6a4485"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98498", "GHSA-j7wh-6jqc-vrfw"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "20396f92-44ac-3afb-9e38-5cf7ce89b6a0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.9"}, {"id": "2beccbdb-dd5f-373c-b7e9-b6fe0b6d31f9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1edae2335adfa7006853e8b427f0c7c3f46b51dd <1f13989a0704bd98cab09f9bee63e2c8a98ad4dd"}, {"id": "2c247477-2038-3107-900d-9164008406b7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "1edae2335adfa7006853e8b427f0c7c3f46b51dd <79a3257280a335bbebbcd10d3895e8468bdcd6ae"}, {"id": "37d521c4-d9dc-3489-b03f-003644